            "ref_slug": "one-to-one-coaching-oc-how-coaching-works",
            "title": "How coaching works",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How coaching works</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here's how the next few months run.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The rhythm</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"hasFixedLayout\":false} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">The call</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Same time every week</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Notes</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Written up straight after, while it's fresh</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Between calls</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">One or two things to work on</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Your check-in</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">A few lines from you the day before</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What I need from you</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tell me when something didn't happen. A week where you did none of it is useful to know about. If you say it went fine when it didn't, we spend the next session working from the wrong place.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:pullquote -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote\"><blockquote><p>Most of the change happens between calls. The sessions are for working out what to change next.</p></blockquote></figure>\n<!-- /wp:pullquote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Between sessions</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Send things as they come up rather than saving them for the call. A quick reply today is usually more use than a long one next week.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who you're working with</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_3}}\",\"width\":\"120px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-rounded\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized is-style-rounded\"><img src=\"{{attachment_url:content_3}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-156\" style=\"width:120px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I'm Maya. I coach founders and freelancers, mostly people who know what they should be doing and aren't doing it. We'll work out what's getting in the way and set up something you can keep going with after we finish.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
            "post_name": "one-to-one-coaching-oc-how-coaching-works",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "one-to-one-coaching-oc-your-goals",
            "title": "Your goals",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your goals</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Have a go at these before the first session. Take your time with them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<!-- Paste the Tally embed code here -->\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About this form</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Client Portal works with any form tool that gives you an embed code. This one is built in Tally, but Gravity Forms, Typeform, Google Forms or whatever you already use works the same way. Paste the embed code into a content page and the form shows here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The form covers the questions below. If you'd rather talk them through on the first call, that's fine too.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where you are now</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What made you decide to do this, and why now?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What does a normal week look like at the moment?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What have you already tried?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where you want to get to</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What's different in six months if this works?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>How will you know you got there? What could you point at?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Which part of that matters most?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What might get in the way</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What's stopped you before?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Who or what needs to change for this to be possible?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What aren't you willing to give up?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There aren't any right answers here, and you're allowed to change your mind later.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
            "post_name": "one-to-one-coaching-oc-your-goals",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "one-to-one-coaching-oc-where-you-are",
            "title": "Where you are",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where you are</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Updated after every session, so you don't have to dig through notes to remember what you said you'd do.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Right now</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Building consistency. We're not adding anything new until the current routine holds for three weeks straight.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">This week</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>📅 Block the two hours on Tuesday and Thursday before anything else gets into the calendar</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>✍️ On any day you skip it, write down what happened in one line</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>📤 Send the draft over by Friday, finished or not</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Parked for now</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The bigger restructure, and anything involving the new tool. Both are worth doing, but not this month.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
            "post_name": "one-to-one-coaching-oc-where-you-are",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "one-to-one-coaching-oc-session-notes",
            "title": "Session notes",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Session notes</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I write these up straight after each session. The document below is shared with you, so you can add to it or comment on anything that doesn't match what you remember agreeing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<!-- Paste the Google Doc embed code here -->\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About this embed</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Client Portal can show anything with an embed code inside a content page. This one is a Google Doc. A Google Sheet, a Notion page or a Loom recording work the same way.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sessions so far</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"hasFixedLayout\":false} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Session</th><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Date</th><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Focus</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">1</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">13 August</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Where you are now, and what six months from now looks like</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">2</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">20 August</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">The week as it is, and the two hours that keep getting moved</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">3</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">27 August</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Blocking the time, and what to do when it gets taken</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">4</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">3 September</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Consistency. Holding the routine for three weeks before adding anything</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n",
            "post_name": "one-to-one-coaching-oc-session-notes",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "one-to-one-coaching-oc-your-check-in",
            "title": "Your check-in",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your check-in</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Send this the day before we speak. It takes about five minutes and means we don't spend the first part of the session catching up.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The questions</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What did you actually do this week?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What didn't you get to, and what got in the way?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What went better than you expected?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Out of ten, how's your energy for this right now?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What do you most want out of the next session?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A sentence each is plenty. Post your answers in the thread below and I'll read them before we speak.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
            "post_name": "one-to-one-coaching-oc-your-check-in",
            "meta": []
        }
    ],
